</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Smooth let it be, or rough,</l><l>It will be still the best;</l><l>Winding or straight it leads</l><l>Right onward to Thy rest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I dare not choose my lot;</l><l>I would not if I might:</l><l>Choose Thou for me, my God,</l><l>So shall I walk aright.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Take Thou my cup, and it</l><l>With joy or sorrow fill,</l><l>As best to Thee may seem;</l><l>Choose Thou my good and ill.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Choose Thou for me my friends,</l><l>My sickness or my health.</l><l>Choose Thou my cares for me,</l><l>My poverty or wealth.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Not mine, not mine the choice,</l><l>In things both great and small;</l><l>Be Thou my guide, my strength,</l><l>My wisdom and my all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
